{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Footers\">Footers</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Add And Footer Footers Invoice Invoices Item Orders Print Quote Quotes To ToDate\">Footers allow you to add static text to the bottom of printed documents such as quotes, orders, invoices, and similar items.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Code Footer Footers Settings\">You can access the <code>Footers</code> feature in the <code>Settings</code> tab.</p><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Footer Footers\">Creating Footers</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Create Footer Footers\">You can create footers using either plain text or HTML format.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Content Edit Footer Footers Is Merge MergeTags On Port Support To ToDate\">Footers support both static text and dynamic content. When creating or editing a footer, you'll see a list of available merge tags that can be used to insert dynamic information.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Add Footer Image On To ToDate\">To add an image to a footer, convert the image to Base64 format using a tool like <a href=\"https://www.base64-image.de\">www.base64-image.de</a>. After conversion, paste the IMG tag into the footer.</p><div class=\"flex pointer-events-none space-x-6 rtl:space-x-reverse items-center\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block ltr:pr-8 rtl:pl-8\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-200 ltr:pl-8 rtl:pr-8\"><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"border-y ltr:border-l rtl:border-r border-neutral-300 bg-white p-4 flex gap-2 items-center\"><i class=\"fas fa-cog text-neutral-400\"></i><span class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Settings\">Settings</span></span></div><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div></div></div><span class=\"rtl:hidden\"><i class=\"fas fa-circle-chevron-right text-lg text-neutral-300\"></i></span><span class=\"ltr:hidden\"><i class=\"fas fa-circle-chevron-left text-lg text-neutral-300\"></i></span><div class=\"border rounded inline-block pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"basis-72 flex items-center gap-2 p-4\"><i class=\"text-xl text-neutral-400 fas fa-fw fa-file-dashed-line\"></i><span class=\"text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Footers\">Footers</span></span></div></div></div><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Footer Footers\">Using Footers</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"By Code Edit Footer Footers Invoice Sales SalesInvoice Select Type\">After creating a footer for a specific document type (such as a sales invoice), you can apply it by selecting the <code>Footers</code> field when editing that document.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action Automatic Code Footer Footers FormDefaults On To ToDate Transaction Transactions\">To automatically apply one or more footers to new transactions, use the <code>Form Defaults</code> feature.</p><p><span translate=\"true\" keywords=\"On\">For more information, see:</span> <a href=\"/guides/form-defaults\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"FormDefaults\">Form Defaults</span></a></p>",
  "key": "footers"
}
